%% Sequence diagram: Face enroll (capture poses -> POST /api/face/enroll -> domain create profile/samples)
sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser
  participant API as /api/face/enroll
  participant Domain as lib/domains/face/enroll()
  participant DB as Postgres/Prisma

  Browser->>Browser: capture pose samples (POSES)
  Browser->>API: POST { staffId, descriptors[] }
  API->>Domain: validate auth (admin) -> enrollProfile(params)
  Domain->>DB: upsert FaceProfile, insert FaceSample rows
  DB-->>Domain: created profile + samples
  Domain-->>API: enrollment success
  API-->>Browser: 200 OK
